    excerpt: 'Retirement planning can feel overwhelming, but it does not have to be. This guide breaks down how to calculate your retirement number, savings benchmarks by age, and what to do if you are behind.',
    featuredImage: 'https://images.pexels.com/photos/8441812/pexels-photo-8441812.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=650&w=940',
